// Requires gfx-lab-input, gfx-lab-output, gfx-lab-drift, gfx-lab-power, gfx-lab-ui, gfx-lab-panel, gfx-lab-os, gfx-lab-bypass, gfx-lab-sidebar, gfx-lab-sliders, gfx-lab-v5-parts (.jsfx-inc) in the same folder.

